reauth_confirm.description:
The gateway at {host} rejected the stored credentials. Enter the current HAN credentials. After a password change it can take a while until the new password becomes active in the gateway.

Installed integration version: {version}

{debug_info}

reconfigure.description:
Update the host, username or password for this gateway. Your existing entities, history and imported statistics are kept - only the connection details change. Optionally, enter a second login for 2.8.0 only. Leaving both fields empty removes it.

Optionally import history again: upload a TraveNetz CSV for 1.8.0 and/or 2.8.0. Leave the upload fields empty for no import.

Installed integration version: {version}

{debug_info}

