tariffs.description:
{status}

The following evaluation profiles (Auswertungsprofile) are visible with these HAN credentials. This can include expired/historical profiles from previous energy supplier changes - choose which ones should be created as entities.

Installed integration version: {version}

{debug_info}

history.description:
{status}

Upload a TraveNetz export file for OBIS 1-0:1.8.0 (grid draw) to import it — no scaling, no other entity. Supports the daily and the 15-minute export (also for dynamic tariffs). Values are anchored backwards from the current meter reading (live from the gateway); no start value is required. Leave both fields empty to skip this step entirely.

Optionally upload a second TraveNetz export file for OBIS 1-0:2.8.0 (feed-in) in the same way. The 2.8.0 import only works if the gateway delivers 2.8.0 (through the first or the second login).

Installed integration version: {version}

export_credentials.description:
{status}

Some grid operators issue separate HAN credentials for consumption (1.8.0) and feed-in (2.8.0). Enter the second login here; it is used to fetch the 2.8.0 values. Leave both fields empty to skip this step: 2.8.0 is then fetched through the first login as before, if that login provides it.

Installed integration version: {version}

{debug_info}

